include/ — shared headers ONLY

Headers here are visible to src/ and, thanks to `-I include` in platformio.ini,
to every module under lib/ as well. Two files live here:

  app_config.h   behaviour tuning (publish policy, thresholds, timeouts)
  secrets.h      Wi-Fi, AWS endpoint, device IDs, PEM strings — gitignored

Do NOT put a .cpp file in this directory. PlatformIO compiles src_dir only;
a .cpp here is silently skipped and you get an "undefined reference" at link
time with no hint about the cause. Module implementations belong in lib/.
